Task 3: Analyzing Successful Logins
Step 1: Find Successful SSH Logins
sudo grep "Accepted password\|Accepted publickey" /var/log/auth.log
This shows successful authentications via password or SSH key.

Step 2: Extract Successful Login Details
sudo grep "Accepted" /var/log/auth.log | awk '{print $1, $2, $3, $9, $11}'
